---
globs:
  - "FUMIRA/DesignSystem/**/*.swift"
  - "FUMIRA/Features/**/*.swift"
---

- Do not hardcode product colors, radii, spacing, shadows, or motion durations in Features.
- Use PosterPalette, PosterSpacing, PosterRadius, PosterMotion, and PosterEffects.
- Functional text uses system typography; poster display text uses PosterTypography.
- Direction H: paper / sky / grassLight / pine / moss / ink. Moss (苔黄) is ≤5% accent only — never a page background or solid primary button fill. Prefer pine or ink for primary buttons. energyLime is deprecated → moss.
- The scene/photo remains the primary visual subject.
- The time rail is continuous ±100 years and must not snap to landmarks.
